# ============================================================================
# BULWARK .gitignore
# Two jobs: (1) standard Unity ignores; (2) HARD EXCLUSION of all reverse-
# engineering / IP / PII artifacts that must NEVER be published (copyright +
# privacy). These belong only to local educational analysis, not the repo.
# NOTE: these paths are ALREADY tracked in history — see docs/adr/ADR-0-001;
# .gitignore alone does not untrack them. Remediation requires a clean repo
# or history rewrite (owner decision).
# ============================================================================

# ---- IP / copyright: Stick War: Legacy game binaries, decompiled code, assets ----
apk/
unpacked/
jadx-out/
report/il2cpp_dump/
**/dump.cs
**/global-metadata.dat
**/*.apk
**/*.so
**/stringliteral.json
**/script.json
**/DummyDll/

# ---- PII / secrets: runtime captures (device IDs, save state, API keys) ----
runtime/
**/*.log
**/recovered_save_state*.txt

# ---- Local RE tooling (large third-party binaries) ----
tools/jadx/
tools/jadx.zip
tools/dotnet/
tools/il2cppdumper/
tools/apktool.jar
tools/*.pkl
report/recovered/

# ============================================================================
# Standard Unity
# ============================================================================
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.unityproj
*.tmp
*.user
.vs/
.idea/
.gradle/
